  "flow": [
    "Attract screen: logo, 한국어/English toggle (whole UI and item names switch), tap the 화면을 터치하여 주문을 시작하세요 panel to start. No dine-in/takeout choice (takeaway only).",
    "Menu: header with fake clock (현재 시각 08:15) and 처음으로; 6 category tabs; item tiles. Simple items have + 담기 that turns into a − n + stepper on the tile; items with options have 옵션 선택 ›.",
    "Option sheet (bottom popup) for items with option groups: single-choice chips, a quantity stepper for 샷 추가, item quantity, 취소 / \"<price> 담기\". Missing required option shows an inline error.",
    "Age confirmation popup (만 19세 이상입니까? 예/아니요) before the age-restricted beer is first added; 아니요 shows an error popup.",
    "Cart drawer slides in from the right when the orange 🛒 장바구니 button (count badge) is tapped: lines with −/+ and ✕, 1+1 free lines at 0원, 전체 삭제 (confirm popup), 합계, 주문하기.",
    "Order review screen (주문 내역 확인): read-only lines, 총 n개, 총 결제금액, 이전 / 결제하기.",
    "Payment method screen (결제 수단 선택): 결제 금액 and 신용·체크카드 / QR 간편결제 / 선불·교통카드. Choosing one only shows a demo notice; the flow stops here."
