    "Tapping anywhere on a simple-item tile adds one (same as + 담기 / +). Tapping an option-item tile opens the option sheet.",
    "The age popup appears only when 활주로 라거 500ml goes from 0 to 1 in the cart. Further + taps (tile or drawer) do not ask again; after removing it, adding asks again.",
    "Cart badge and 총 n개 count free 1+1 units too (1 banana milk -> badge 2).",
    "Option items with identical selections merge into one cart line; different selections become separate lines. Option-item tiles never show a stepper.",
    "Defaults: 사이즈 = 레귤러, 선물 포장 = 포장 안 함, 샷 추가 = 0. 데우기 여부, 소스 선택, 온도, 색상 have no default; pressing 담기 without them shows 필수 옵션을 선택해 주세요: <group>.",
    "In holdout orders a quantity group is written by repeating the option id (shot: [\"shot\",\"shot\"] = 2 extra shots); default selections are written out explicitly.",
    "Max 10 per cart line; exceeding it shows an error popup. The sheet quantity stops at 10.",
    "Prices use 원 in both languages (e.g. \"4,500원\" in English too).",
    "The language can only be changed on the start screen. 처음으로 with a non-empty cart asks for confirmation, then empties the cart and resets the language to Korean.",
    "DOM text merges: tile name and price (\"꿀바나나우유1,800원\"), cart button and badge (\"🛒 장바구니4\"), cart line name and option summary.",
    "주문하기 with an empty cart shows an error popup 장바구니가 비어 있습니다. 상품을 담아 주세요.",
